<span class="os-number">12</span><span class="os-divider">. </span>
<div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1164566044566">If a pulley system can lift a 200N load with an effort force of 52 N and has an efficiency of almost 100 percent, how many ropes are supporting the load?</p>
<ol id="fs-id1164565343388" type="a">
<li>1 rope is required because the actual mechanical advantage is 0.26.</li>
<li>1 rope is required because the actual mechanical advantage is 3.80.</li>
<li>4 ropes are required because the actual mechanical advantage is 0.26.</li>
<li>4 ropes are required because the actual mechanical advantage is 3.80.</li></ol>
